# Client video masters (.mov straight off the phone) are 30-120MB each and one
# exceeds GitHub's hard 100MB file limit, which blocks the push outright.
# Decision 6 Aug 2026: keep them out of git rather than take on Git LFS quota.
#
# The site is unaffected — it serves the transcoded public/videos/*.mp4, which
# ARE committed. These are archival originals only.
#
# Since 7 Aug 2026 they ARE backed up: scripts/sync-cdn.sh mirrors
# client-assets to the private, versioned S3 bucket shield-gate-repair-masters,
# which is the only copy of these files outside the working drive. Run it after
# adding footage. Masters committed before 6 Aug 2026 also remain retrievable
# from git history.
client-assets/videos/*.mov
